    {
      "id": "action_network:dab321d8-c427-4449-a9ec-d315ffb138df",
      "name": "NYHA LABOR POWER MAPPING",
      "date": "2026-10-04T13:00:00Z",
      "date_formatted": "1:00 PM, Sunday October 4, 2026",
      "month_year": "2026-10",
      "month_label": "October 2026",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "description": "<div><strong>Join us Sunday, October 4th for NYHA Labor Power Mapping!</strong></div><div><br></div><div>We\u2019re bringing together NYC union members and advocates to learn and practice power mapping! We\u2019ll look at our unions / workplaces, identify existing relationships, and identify where we already have relationships or where we need to build them.</div><div><br></div><div>We\u2019ll be working through our actual unions and workplaces, <strong>so please bring a laptop!</strong></div><div><br></div><div>\ud83d\udcc5 Sunday, October 4</div><div>\u23f0 1\u20133 PM</div><div>\ud83d\udccd DSA Midtown, 315 W 35th St</div><div>\ud83d\udcbb Bring your laptop</div><div><br></div><div>Due to the nature of this work, this session is in person only</div>",
      "browser_url": "https://actionnetwork.org/events/power-mapping-for-the-new-york-health-act",
      "signup_url": "https://actionnetwork.org/events/power-mapping-for-the-new-york-health-act",
      "location": "315 W 35th St",
      "borough": "New York "
    },
    {
      "id": "action_network:3380aec2-1f88-4a53-b9a4-da4f9379ea4e",
      "name": "Art Build for New York Health Act ",
      "date": "2026-10-05T17:00:00Z",
      "date_formatted": "5:00 PM, Monday October 5, 2026",
      "month_year": "2026-10",
      "month_label": "October 2026",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "description": "<p>We plan on screen printing pulling squeegee,  drying printed material, painting banners with brush work and maybe stencil,, and sewing bike bibbs, and perhaps printing posters as well</p><p>The correct address will be sent upon RSVP </p>",
      "browser_url": "https://actionnetwork.org/events/art-build-for-nyha",
      "signup_url": "https://actionnetwork.org/events/art-build-for-nyha",
      "location": "215 w 23rd st",
      "borough": "New York"
    },
    {
      "id": "action_network:b6372da0-334e-422b-8183-c00f7903628c",
      "name": "NYHA presser @ Hochul office",
      "date": "2026-10-17T10:00:00Z",
      "date_formatted": "10:00 AM, Saturday October 17, 2026",
      "month_year": "2026-10",
      "month_label": "October 2026",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "description": "<div><div><div>DSA will condemn the worst of the for-profit health insurance companies and present the New York Health Act as the alternative at a news conference in front of Hochul's office.</div><div>A Hochul impersonation will illustrate the difference between putting people first and going along with corporate exploitation of the health system to rake in profits. &nbsp;</div><p>DSA run club members will pour into the Midtown event in the spirit of all New Yorkers running toward healthy lives, a humane health system, and a socialist future.</p><div>Interested media will find out what else socialists want for New York now while asking Governor Hochul, Which side are you on?</div><div><br></div></div></div><span></span>",
      "browser_url": "https://actionnetwork.org/events/dsa-flexes-muscle-for-nyha-presser",
      "signup_url": "https://actionnetwork.org/events/dsa-flexes-muscle-for-nyha-presser",
      "location": "919 3rd Ave (entry on E 55th btwn 2nd & 3rd)",
      "borough": "New York"
    },
